  "identifier": "tooluniverse",
  "name": "ToolUniverse",
  "description": "Native MCP server exposing 211+ expert-curated biomedical tools to any MCP-compatible AI agent. Tools span drug discovery, therapeutic reasoning, precision oncology, rare disease diagnosis, pharmacovigilance, multi-omics analysis, protein docking, and literature search across PubMed, Semantic Scholar, ArXiv, BioRxiv, and Europe PMC. Supports MCP Tasks for non-blocking execution of long-running operations such as molecular simulations and protein docking. Developed by the Zitnik Lab at Harvard Medical School as infrastructure for AI scientist systems. Powers TxAgent's therapeutic reasoning capabilities.",
  "url": "https://zitniklab.hms.harvard.edu/TxAgent/",
